```Before vs after cut-over for one app: same users, same destinations - did error rates move? Legacy proxy logs vs Netskope transaction logs.```
(index=proxy sourcetype=proxy:csv) OR (index=netskope sourcetype="netskope:web_transaction*")
| eval platform=if(index="netskope","netskope","legacy")
| eval host_=coalesce(dest, 'cs-host'), user_=coalesce(user, 'cs-username'),
       code=coalesce(status, 'sc-status')
| lookup app_inventory domain AS host_ OUTPUT app
| search app="Salesforce"
| stats count AS requests dc(user_) AS users
        sum(eval(if(code>=400 OR code=0,1,0))) AS errors BY platform
| eval error_pct=round(100*errors/requests,2)
